description-alias = Additional names exposed by the runtime.
description-tags = Runtime catalogue tags.
description-mmproj = Absolute path to a multimodal projector.
description-no-mmproj = Disable automatic projector selection.
description-n-gpu-layers = Layers stored in VRAM: a number, auto, or all.
description-gpu-layers = Native alias for the GPU layer count.
description-n-cpu-moe = Keep expert weights of the first N layers on the CPU.
description-moe-cache-mib = VRAM cache for CPU-resident experts, in MiB.
description-fit = Adjust unset options to fit available device memory.
description-flash-attn = Flash Attention mode: on, off, or auto.
description-ctx-size = Maximum context length in tokens.
description-parallel = Number of parallel inference slots.
description-batch-size = Maximum logical batch size in tokens.
description-ubatch-size = Maximum physical batch size in tokens.
description-ctx-checkpoints = Maximum context checkpoints per slot.
description-no-context-shift = Disable shifting when the context fills.
description-context-shift = Shift context to continue long generations.
description-cache-ram = Prompt cache limit in MiB; -1 means unlimited.
description-dedup-cache-models = Hide a cached entry when this preset uses the same model file.
description-cache-type-k = Storage type for KV cache keys.
description-cache-type-v = Storage type for KV cache values.
description-threads = CPU threads used during generation.
description-threads-batch = CPU threads used for batch processing.
description-jinja = Render prompts using Jinja chat templates.
description-reasoning = Reasoning mode: on, off, or auto.
description-reasoning-format = How reasoning content is represented in responses.
description-temp = Sampling temperature; lower values reduce randomness.
description-top-p = Keep tokens within this cumulative probability.
description-top-k = Limit sampling to the K most likely tokens.
description-min-p = Exclude tokens below this relative probability.
description-stop-timeout = Graceful shutdown timeout in seconds.
description-load-on-startup = Automatic model loading is disabled.
